cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "csv-quality-gate: CSV preflight validation that fails fast before pipeline runs"
abstract: >-
  csv-quality-gate is a data quality gate that validates CSV inputs (missing
  required columns, empty files, duplicate rows, empty required cells, and junk
  contact rows via the outreach profile) and returns pass / warn / fail with
  matching exit codes, so a broken CSV is caught before a batch or pipeline run
  wastes time on bad data. Stdlib-only, no third-party runtime dependencies.
type: software
authors:
